@braun_appearance
# scenario-ledger: FAR-04, FAR-05, FAR-06
# prose-audit: Grade A — Appearance, flight and a narrow detention are derived from one stored legal roll and the prior procedural record; Lewica controls only oversight and public response before a separate charging page.
title: Braun reaches the appearance stage
subtitle: The stored record decides appearance, narrow detention or flight; none is a conviction
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 48
order: 41
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and braun_stage = 1 and time >= braun_due_time and braun_done = 0 and election_2027_terminal = 0
on-arrival: {!
const integrity = Number(Q.braun_procedure_score || 0) +
    Number(Q.braun_legal_preparation || 0) +
    Number(Q.prosecution_independence || 0) * 0.12 -
    Number(Q.braun_martyrdom || 0) * 0.10;
const roll = Number(Q.braun_legal_roll) || 0;
if (Q.braun_compulsion_strategy == "Pre-trial detention and one broad extremist case" && roll < 420) {
    Q.braun_outcome = "Braun leaves Poland before the compelled appearance";
} else if (integrity >= 18 || roll >= 250) {
    Q.braun_outcome = "Braun appears under a narrow compulsion order and is released after the procedural acts";
} else {
    Q.braun_outcome = "A court permits brief detention after another documented refusal to appear";
}
Q.braun_stage = 2;
Q.news_headline = Q.braun_outcome;
!}

= [+ date_label +] — Appearance is not judgment

**[+ braun_outcome +].** The Oleśnica file, the older indictment and the speech
files retain separate evidence ledgers. Flight permits proceedings that Polish
law allows in absence; detention secures a procedural act. Neither supplies a
finding of guilt.

- @braun_appearance_watch
- @braun_appearance_restraint

