@psl_exit_toleration
# scenario-ledger: PSL-07
# prose-audit: Grade A — PSL's threshold and cabinet status trigger an externally determined resignation; portfolios become vacant and toleration replaces coalition membership without inventing cabinet defeat.
title: PSL exits the cabinet without overthrowing it
subtitle: Ministers resign and publish toleration terms; confidence remains a separate constitutional question
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 48
order: 43
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and psl_stage = 0 and ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 1 and (psl_ratchet_score >= 60 or government_coalition_dissent >= 65 or psl_coalition_dissent >= 65) and election_2027_terminal = 0
on-arrival: {!
const psl = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record && record.id == "psl_party";
});
if (psl) {
    psl.in_cabinet = 0;
    psl.support_mode = "toleration";
}
for (const portfolio of ["finance", "justice", "foreign", "defence", "interior", "health", "education", "social", "agriculture", "climate", "development", "infrastructure", "culture", "digital", "eu"]) {
    if (Q[portfolio + "_minister_party"] == "PSL") {
        Q[portfolio + "_minister_party"] = "vacant";
        Q[portfolio + "_minister"] = "Vacant — prime-ministerial appointment pending";
    }
}
Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 0;
Q.psl_support_mode = "toleration";
Q.psl_outcome = "Cabinet exit with published budget and confidence toleration";
Q.psl_stage = 1;
Q.psl_due_time = Number(Q.time) + 2;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 9;
Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(Number(Q.early_election_risk || 0), 38);
Q.news_headline = "PSL resigns its ministries but does not join a no-confidence majority";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — Resignation is not collapse

PSL ministers leave their offices. The party publishes the votes it will still
supply on confidence, the budget and emergency legislation. The cabinet has
fewer members and a less reliable budget path; it has not been defeated.

