title: Publish the candidate map, shares and premiership bargain
subtitle: Show each signatory exactly how Duda's common ballot line preserves its place.
on-arrival: election_information_integrity += 5; media_capacity += 3; public_trust += 2; news_headline = "Prawica publishes its candidate map, internal shares and premier bargain"

[? if sejm_electoral_system = "mixed_230" or sejm_electoral_system = "fptp_460":
The published map makes Duda's argument concrete: one Prawica nominee contests
each JOW, and each signatory receives districts through the negotiated allocation.
They banded together because competing right-wing nominees would cancel each
other out.?][? if sejm_electoral_system = "proportional": The election engine
counts Prawica once at the coalition threshold and preserves the negotiated
component allocation.?]

