on-arrival: party_unity += 3; progressive_credibility += 2; ko_relation -= 3; p2050_relation -= 3; psl_relation -= 3; news_headline = "Lewica treats a shared centre list as one opponent without erasing its components"

The ballot line is one; the coalition channels remain several.

